{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42265","headline":"送许郎中歙州判官兼黟县 · 徐铉","name":"送许郎中歙州判官兼黟县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻黟县似桃源，况是优游冠玳筵。\n遗爱非遥应卧理，祖风犹在好寻仙。\n朝衣旧识熏香史，禄米初营种秫田。\n大抵宦游须自适，莫辞离别二三年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}